  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with an o→ue stem change in the stressed syllables: presente (all but nosotros/nosotras), subjuntivo presente (all but nosotros/nosotras), and imperativo afirmativo tú/usted/ustedes forms. Nosotros/nosotras always reverts to the unstressed stem (volamos, volemos), as expected for -AR/-ER stem-changers.",
    "Past participle is regular: **volado**.",
    "*El avión vuela sobre las montañas.* (\"The plane flies over the mountains.\")",
    "*Volamos a México el próximo mes.* (\"We're flying to Mexico next month.\")",
    "Related: *el vuelo* (flight, noun), *el volante* (steering wheel — unrelated meaning), *volador/a* (flying, adjective)."
  ],
